            "value": "Your finished workouts will appear here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre clé reste dans le Trousseau de cet appareil : elle n’est ni exportée, ni synchronisée, ni écrite dans les journaux. Muscu n’embarque aucune clé.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your key stays in the Keychain of this device: it is neither exported, nor synced, nor written to the journals. Muscu ships no key of its own."
